"Hello. I'm facing another issue while using R-SWAT (ArcSWAT) and I would like to inquire about it. Currently, I am using code developed without a UI to run R-SWAT (ArcSWAT). I am conducting a hydrological simulation, using data from three observation points within the watershed. However, there is a slight difference in the observation dates for the three points. I have set the simulation time based on the data from the observation point with the longest period. However, an error occurs during the calculation of 'calculate 95ppu.' I am wondering if there is a requirement for the observation data to have the same duration for all three points. I look forward to your response. Thank you."

