The duration of the observed data file need to be the same in all observed files (unless you use the option - userReadSwatOutput". However, the data at different points are available at different time period - to solve it - put NA in the date that there is no data in the data column. In the attached figure is an example when I calibrate for two variables, one with observed data is avaiable from 2000-01-03 and the other variable which observed data is available at 2000-01-01 with some missing values

